;;; EXERCISE

#|
1. Create a magic square of 7. 

2. For the pitches transpose it 2 octaves down.
Use [integer-transpose] for it.

3. Make dynamics between ppp and ff for each
of the liste of the magic square: 
highest number = lowest dynamic
lowest number = highest dynamic
Using [vector-to-velocity] for it.

3. Create 7 random lengths per voice with the same
overall duration e.g. make random order of a given
list of lengths.

4. Use preview-score to view and play the score.
|#

;;; ---------------------------------------------------------
